{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of the most efficient airports in the world, Richmond International Airport (RIC) not far from Washington DC, located around 7 miles to the southeast of the state capital.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serves 21 destinations throughout the United States via nine major carriers to the tune of almost 3.5 million annual passengers and major cargo activities.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Realistic modeling with over 50 custom modelled buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Detailed ground polygon model.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Updated Radar screens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Taxi signs and hand placed taxi lights around the airport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Dynamic runway approach lighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Beautiful background scenery using OSM (open street map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546350/extras/KRIC3.jpg?t=1740479953\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The central location within Virginia and the mid-Atlantic region attracts over three million travelers each year, enough to keep the \u201cOpen V\u201d runway configuration in a steadily busy state. The airport has three asphalt-grooved runways to accommodate traffic, with the longest runway measuring 9,003 feet in length by 150 feet in width.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RIC is served by airlines flying primarily domestic routes to cities in the South, Northeast and Midwest, and connecting flights to major hubs for international destinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Runway Lights:16-34 HIRL CL, TDZ; 7-25 HIRL; 2-20 HIRL</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","b